      ],
      "source": "https://www.siloamsprings.com/211/History",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "John Brown University, established in 1887, hosts concerts, theater, and gallery shows, making it a cultural hub.",
